          {
            "text": "EXT. BRICK'S PATIO - DAY",
            "styles": [
              "bold"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "sceneNumber": null
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "A gorgeous day.  The sun is shining.  But BRICK BRADDOCK, retired police detective, is sitting quietly, contemplating -- something.",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "alignment": "standard"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "The SCREEN DOOR slides open and DICK STEEL, his former partner and fellow retiree, emerges with two cold beers.",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "alignment": "standard"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "STEEL",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Beer's ready!",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "BRICK",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Are they cold?",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "STEEL",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Does a bear crap in the woods?",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "Steel sits.  They laugh at the dumb joke.",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "alignment": "standard"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "STEEL",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "(beer raised)",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "To retirement.",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "BRICK",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "To retirement.",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "They drink long and well from the beers.",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "alignment": "standard"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "And then there's a long beat.\nLonger than is funny.\nLong enough to be depressing.",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "alignment": "standard"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "The men look at each other.",
            "styles": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "alignment": "standard"
