    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "This is the home of THE BOY BAND, AKA DAN and JACK.  They too are drinking beer, and counting the take from their last smash-and-grab.  Money, drugs, and ridiculous props are strewn about the table.",
